<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australis rescue deal to rise - source.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australis rescue deal to rise - source.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pay television operator Australis Media Ltd plans to announce later on Friday a modified equity funding package injecting more than the US$105 million originally announced in August, a source close to the company said.</p>
<p>Australis would also announce it had secured the approval from U.S. bondholders needed for a new bond issue of between US$150 million to US$170 million by October this year, the source said.</p>
</text>
